title: Party Disunity
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: party_disunity_timer = 0 and (dissent >= 0.3 or (center_dissent > 30 and not centrists_resign) or (internationalist_dissent > 30 and not internationalist_leaves) or (labor_dissent > 30 and not unions_independent) or (nationalist_dissent > 30 and not nationalist_split))
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; party_disunity_timer = 4
card-image: img/Klubpps.jpg
frequency: 200
tags: party_affairs

= Party Disunity

The party is being torn apart by internal dissent. Upset at the leadership and general direction, factions have started sabotaging their rivals, hampering our efforts to win votes and carry out our policies.

[? if internationalist_dissent > 30: internationalists are making noises about another party split. ?]
[? if center_dissent > 30 : The centrists are displeased with the direction of our party. ?]
[? if labor_dissent > 30 : The trade unions disagree with our present course of action. ?]
[? if nationalist_dissent > 30 : The nationalist are upset with the actions of our party. ?]

Something must be done to reinforce party unity.

- @enforce_unity
- @concessions_internationalist
- @concessions_center
- @concessions_labor
- @concessions_nationalist
- @do_nothing
- @easy_discard

@enforce_unity
title: Enforce party discipline.
on-arrival: center_dissent -= 5; nationalist_dissent -= 5; internationalist_issent -= 5; workers_pps -= 4; petit_pps -= 2; unemployed_pps -= 2

Enforcing party discipline reduces dissent, but it could lead to an exit of dissenting members.

# enforcing party discipline applies to all parties.

# each party has a concessions action and an expulsions action.

@concessions_center
title: Give concessions to the centrists.
view-if: center_dissent > 30
on-arrival: center_strength += 3; center_dissent -= 15; nationalist_dissent += 8; internationalist_dissent += 8

We have promised to take more policy suggestions from the centrists. Both the nationalist and internationalist wings of the party might be displeased.

@concessions_internationalist
title: Give concessions to the internationalists.
view-if: internationalist_dissent > 30
on-arrival: internationalist_strength += 3; internationalist_dissent -= 15; nationalist_dissent += 10; center_dissent += 5

We have promised that we will listen to the left wing of the party. Of course, this leads to increased dissent from the nationalist.

@concessions_labor
title: Give concessions to labor.
view-if: labor_dissent > 30
on-arrival: labor_strength += 3; labor_dissent -= 15; center_dissent += 10

The trade unions will be granted more influence in party decision making. This upsets the centrists, who would prefer to centralize political decision making within the party.

@concessions_nationalist
title: Give concessions to the nationalists.
view-if: nationalist_dissent > 30
on-arrival: nationalist_strength += 3; nationalist_dissent -= 15; center_dissent += 5; internationalist_dissent += 10

We have promised to adopt a more nationalist stance for our policies. This displeases the internationalist and centrists of our party.

@do_nothing
title: Let the factions argue with themselves.
on-arrival: nationalist_dissent += 2; internationalist_dissent += 2; labor_dissent += 1; center_dissent += 1

Let the factions bicker; perhaps dissent is healthy for the party.

